docs {
  # Create Transit - International Flight

  Example of international flight with DIFFERENT departure and arrival timezones.

  **Timezone Handling**:
  - `departure_timezone`: "America/Los_Angeles" (UTC-8)
  - `arrival_timezone`: "Asia/Tokyo" (UTC+9)
  - Times are stored as Unix timestamps (UTC)
  - Client can convert using timezone info

  This is why having separate timezone fields is critical for international travel!
}
